# dsh-passwords 容器专用环境变量模板（可选进阶配置）：普通安装只需一条
# docker run -d -e DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=... -e SETUP_KEY=... -p 127.0.0.1:3088:3088 ...，
# 无需本文件；SETUP_KEY 会在首次初始化时写入卷内 .env 并保持不变。
# 需要自定义端口/域名/SSH 端点/第三方端点登记等高级项时，再 cp docker/.env.example
# docker/.env 后填写，用 docker run --env-file docker/.env 或 docker compose --env-file
# docker/.env 传入；命令行 -e 的优先级高于 --env-file。
# 不要用仓库根的 .env.example（宿主机模板）：它会注入占位 SETUP_KEY 与
# MCP_GATEWAY_PORT=443，覆盖镜像的 3088，导致容器不监听/网关拒绝启动。
# dsh 的模型密钥（必填）：https://platform.deepseek.com/
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=

# 对外公开主机名（可选）：登录链接等对外地址用它拼接；留空则按请求头推断
MCP_GATEWAY_PUBLIC_HOST=

# Third-party endpoint registry (comma-separated): `[owner:][ws:|http:]path`.
# Prefixes are optional and order-agnostic. `owner:` rules are reachable by the owner
# only (subusers get 403 on both transports); every other rule requires BOTH the owner
# registration and the subuser's SSH toggle. `ws:`/`http:` restrict a rule to one
# transport; a bare path applies to both. Exact paths, or a trailing /* matching direct
# child paths only. Unregistered third-party paths (/api/* and root-level plugin routes)
# are denied for subusers. Register the minimal set (registration grants the whole path).
MCP_GATEWAY_SSH_ENDPOINTS=

# Bundled DSH version (optional; defaults to the release baseline)
#DSH_VERSION=0.2.1-alpha.1
